# Ignore all .terraform folders anywhere in the project
**/.terraform/

# Ignore all state files anywhere in the project
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Ignore all lock files anywhere in the project
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Ignore all zip files anywhere in the project
**/*.zip

# Ignore variable files (can hold secrets or passwords)
**/*.tfvars

# Ignore Terraform crash logs and saved plans
**/crash.log
**/tfplan

# Ignore temp file from the Day 20 ping test
**/params.json
